ersteps their bounds or oversteps  proper procedure in the way that they  deal with us getting the charges dropped  is a victory but Nicholas plans to  continue fighting he is filing a claim  for civil damages against Monterey  County to cover his legal expenses in  addition to physical and emotional costs
 

